.env
# Local secrets at every directory level; keep the empty template.
.env.*
# '.env 복사본' 처럼 공백·접미어가 붙은 비밀 파일도 막는다(2026-11-17 '.env datemate' 가 실수로 커밋됨).
.env *
*.env
.env-*
!.env.example
.dev.vars*
node_modules/
.wrangler/
# Built by cloudflare/build-edge-pages.mjs on every wrangler deploy/dev.
/cloudflare/generated/

.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

/datemate/runtime/
/datemate/backups/
/datemate/restore-*/
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Local logs and OS metadata
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.neon
.claude/fable-handoff.md
